OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies enjoy festive escape from
OL,4,Ahospitals on special Santa train       
OL,6,FFor many children, a trip to see Santa 
OL,7,Fis a familiar part of the countdown to 
OL,8,FChristmas but for some families finding
OL,9,Fan experience they can enjoy together  
OL,10,Fis not easy.                           
OL,12,FThat is why a special Christmas train  
OL,13,Fwas laid on for hundreds of children   
OL,14,Fwith health problems, giving them the  
OL,15,Fchance to enjoy a free festive day out 
OL,16,Fwith their families.                   
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
