OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies enjoy festive escape from
OL,4,Ahospitals on special Santa train       
OL,6,FThose who took part said the           
OL,7,Fexperience, arranged by the Royal      
OL,8,FWolverhampton NHS Trust Charity (RWTC) 
OL,9,Fand Chasewater Railway in              
OL,10,FStaffordshire, allowed them to spend   
OL,11,Frare quality time with their children, 
OL,12,Faway from hospitals and appointments.  
OL,14,FAmong them was Vinnie, who has cerebral
OL,15,Fpalsy, and his family.                 
